{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99078","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99078/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99078/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99078/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99078","id":1874944297,"node_id":"I_kwDOAAe_f85vwWEp","number":99078,"title":"It is impossible to create a follower index with `$` character in its name","user":{"login":"idegtiarenko","id":1331856,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzE4NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1331856?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko","html_url":"https://github.com/idegtiarenko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/idegtiarenko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":912824565,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5MTI4MjQ1NjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Distributed/CCR","name":":Distributed/CCR","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Issues around the Cross Cluster State Replication features"},{"id":1967496670,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2Njcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Distributed","name":"Team:Distributed","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for distributed team."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2023-08-31T07:27:32Z","updated_at":"2023-10-04T18:07:59Z","closed_at":"2023-10-04T18:07:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Description\n\nIt is impossible to create a follower index with a `$` character in its name (please note, it is possible to create a regular index with `$` in its name).\r\n\r\nThis could be reproduced by rest request:\r\n```\r\nPUT /my-index/_ccr/follow\r\n{\r\n    \"remote_cluster\": \"my-remote-cluster\",\r\n    \"leader_index\": \"my-index$follower\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nor `CcrIntegTestCase`:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    public void testFollowIndex() throws Exception {\r\n        assertAcked(leaderClient().admin().indices().prepareCreate(\"my$index\"));\r\n        setupRemoteCluster();\r\n        final PutFollowAction.Request followRequest = putFollow(\"my$index\", \"my$index\");\r\n        followerClient().execute(PutFollowAction.INSTANCE, followRequest).get();\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is happening as during initial follow phase we restore the leader cluster from the remote using a snapshot restore.\r\nCorresponding request is created with index name added to `RestoreSnapshotRequest#renamePattern` (regexp) without escaping `$`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Tim-Brooks","id":862472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjQ3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks","html_url":"https://github.com/Tim-Brooks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99078/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99078/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}